# - LLAMA_MOE_ROUTE_STATS: counts the bias's swaps (1) or also writes per-token routing records (a path), from an unbiased softmax
#   kept beside the fused top-k kernel so the bias path stays bit-identical; LLAMA_MOE_ROUTE_BIAS_LAYERS: the bias in chosen layers
#   only, optionally scaled ("a-b[:s],..."); LLAMA_MOE_ROUTE_DROP: swapped-in experts get weight 0 (screening only).
# - llama-perplexity: LLAMA_KLD_DUMP=<path> writes per-position KL divergence, probability difference, losses and top tokens
#   ("KLD1" format, read by scripts/paired.py).
