     pending_plan defer_st;
 
+    // GPU_bias_test: LLAMA_MOE_ROUTE_STATS=1 (or a file path: per-token records too).  With the route bias on, the unbiased selection
+    // scores of each small-batch lookup (src[0] of the graph's ffn_moe_probs_cache_bias node, kept allocated by the graph) are read
+    // with the selected experts; the host compares the unbiased top-k with the selection: the experts the bias swapped in, the
+    // unbiased score mass the swaps gave up, and the favoured (cached or being filled) share of both sets
+    static int route_stats_mode() {
